## Command

```shell
biome migrate stylelint --include-nursery
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "enabled": true } }
```

## `.stylelintrc.json`

```json
{
        "rules": {
            "max-nesting-depth": [
                2,
                {
                    "ignore": ["blockless-at-rules"],
                    "ignoreAtRules": ["media", "/^my-/", "/^your-/i"]
                }
            ]
        },
        "overrides": [
            {
                "files": ["*.scss"],
                "rules": {
                    "max-nesting-depth": [3, { "ignoreAtRules": "include", "severity": "warning" }]
                }
            }
        ]
    }
```

